Z||000017||87GTZ34||11-28-2001||09:59 PM||||Once you get an SES light you will have a code set until either you reset, or you get a number of consecutive starts with no problem.  I forgot the number... Anyway, that light is/was most likely an EGR code as mine does the same thing.  Check codes and post back.  GL||||reg||1
